    <string name="bug_hud_nav_oem">My car\'s built-in navigation</string>
    <string name="bug_hud_nav_unsupported_msg">DashCast can only mirror the arrows on the HUD from Google Maps or Waze. Your car\'s built-in navigation (Telenav…) sends its data in a format DashCast can\'t read — but it already shows its own arrows on the HUD. To get arrows through DashCast, start a route with Google Maps or Waze.</string>
